{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.NeutronProtonMassSplitting","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.NeutronProtonMassSplitting","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.splitting_of_scaleHypothesis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.splitting_of_scaleHypothesis","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L96-L100","doc":"Conditional on (H_α) at `α = 3.7445`, the model splitting is `≈ 1.0541` MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.ScaleHypothesis.conversion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.ScaleHypothesis.conversion","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L94-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.ScaleHypothesis.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.ScaleHypothesis.mk","kind":"ctor","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L93-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.ScaleHypothesis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.ScaleHypothesis","kind":"class","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L87-L94","doc":"**Hypothesis (H_α), not derived.** The model neutron–proton mass difference `Δm`\nequals the binding scale `α` times the change of the quark-ordering traced volume.\nThis is the one underived step of `prop:neutron-proton-mass-splitting`\n(owner ruling 2026-11-15: state it as a named hypothesis). It is a\ncontent-bearing class with **no instance**: nothing in the corpus derives it.\nAudit: `docs/audits/2026-11-15-np-splitting-error-budget.md` §15–§19. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.splitting_value","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.splitting_value","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L76-L85","doc":"At `α = 3.7445`: `Δm ≈ 1.0541` (MeV units), convention D.\nConditional on (H_α): that `α = m_e·8G` converts `|ΔΦ|` to energy is an\nassumption of the block, not derived; this theorem is arithmetic only.\nModel value only; the comparison with the measured splitting is an\nempirical claim and lives in the block prose.  Under the retired\nconvention C this goal read `|Δm − 1.302| < 0.001`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:neutron-proton-mass-splitting","label":"prop:neutron-proton-mass-splitting","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.massSplitting","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.massSplitting","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L70-L74","doc":"The mass splitting from quark crossing change.\nReplacing uu (σ, eigenvalue q) with dd (σ⁻¹, eigenvalue q⁻¹)\nincreases confinement energy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.quarkPhi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.quarkPhi","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L60-L68","doc":"Quark-ordering quantum-dilogarithm volume — the rounded evaluation of\n[`quarkPhiClosedForm`](#QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.quarkPhiClosedForm) at\n`q₀`, convention D (`Φ(uud) ≈ -0.614886`, `Φ(udd) ≈ -0.896395`, computed\nat 50 dps).  The convention-C values `-0.878526`, `-1.226119` are retired\nand kept only as a historical comparison in the block prose. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.quarkPhiClosedForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.quarkPhiClosedForm","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L56-L58","doc":"The closed form at the canonical convention-D parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.quarkPhiClosedFormAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.quarkPhiClosedFormAt","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L36-L54","doc":"**Closed-form quark-ordering volume** `Φ(K) = log|∏ᵢ V̂ᵢ(K)|`, the exact\nHecke traced-volume at the Markov parameter `z`, with each strand paired\nwith every later strand (`level1-qvalues.py`).  Provenance:\n`docs/audits/2026-07-11-quark-volume-provenance.md`.\n\n  Φ(uud) = log|(z q² + 2q − z)(q² − 2z q − 1) / (4 q²)|\n  Φ(udd) = log|(q²+1)²(q² − z q − 1) / (4 q³)|\n\n**Convention D (owner ruling 2026-11-15: replace convention-C values with\nconvention D even if worse).**  The file previously folded the\nconvention-C `z = 4993/10000` (rounded `√q/(q+1)`) into integer\ncoefficients, which no convention detector could see (bean `qou-wgta`).\nThe closed form is now written in `z` and evaluated at `zD`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.zD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.zD","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L32-L34","doc":"Convention-D Markov parameter `z_D = q³/(q²+1)` at `q₀` (canonical;\nowner rulings 2026-08-15 and 2026-11-15). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.q0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NeutronProtonSplitting.q0","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/neutron-proton-mass-splitting.lean#L26-L30","doc":"Substrate modulus `q₀`, the canonical 50-dps pin\n(`q_parameter.Q_50_DIGIT_STR`; `q_parameter.Q` is its f64 view).  Full\nprecision matches `QOU.LiftingDescent.H3BraneTowerScaffold.q0`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}